    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0254_sister_03",
      "hash64": "B59D7FDD3BCB7B7E",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Oooh, how fun! Go on,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]!\\r\\nDo\\r\\nit!\\r\\nYou\\r\\nhave\\r\\nmy\\r\\npermission![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
